"uses":[8,0]},{"text":"Lower the heat to medium. Add the garlic and ginger and stir until fragrant, {time 30 sec}. Whisk the sauce again, since the cornstarch settles, then pour it in and stir until it bubbles and turns thick and glossy, {time 1-2 min}.","uses":[11,12]},{"text":"Return the beef, broccoli and any juices from the plate to the pan. Toss until everything is coated and heated through, {time 1 min}. Serve over the rice.","uses":[0,9,13]}]}